# Datasets and generated artifacts — never committed (PRD §6)
data/
results/

# RESULTS.md IS committed, so the paper's numbers stay diffable across runs.
#
# It is written by hand, not generated. The original plan was to generate it
# from evaluation/report.py, and that was the wrong shape: the document's value
# is in what the numbers *mean* -- which ablation overturned which assumption,
# which caveat attaches to which figure -- and none of that comes out of a
# metrics table. report.py still renders the tables that go into it.
#
# The rule that replaces "never hand-edit": every figure in RESULTS.md must be
# traceable to a run directory or a named script. Its Provenance section lists
# them, and results/*/config_hash.txt pins the config each was produced under.

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
coverage.xml

